<div class="page-wrap">

  <!-- MASTHEAD -->
  <header class="masthead anim a1">
    <div class="masthead-kicker">Supply Chain &amp; Climate Analysis</div>
    <h1>Where Food Is Lost, and&nbsp;Where Carbon Follows</h1>
    <p class="masthead-sub">A multi-stage examination of global food waste flows, embedded carbon emissions, avoidable loss proportions, and the regional divergence between high-income and low-income supply chains — with signals for priority intervention.</p>
    <div class="masthead-meta">
      <span class="meta-pill">Source: FAO / UNEP 2021–2023</span>
