  <!-- ══ SECTION 1: WASTE FLOW + CARBON JUXTAPOSITION ══ -->
  <div class="section-break anim a2">
    <div class="section-label">Section 01 — Global Composition</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Waste Share vs. Carbon Intensity by Stage</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">At the global average, consumption dominates waste volume (43%), yet production carries disproportionate carbon weight — its 24% waste share generates 30.5% of food-waste emissions. Both paired bars are shown below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-2 anim a3">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Global Waste Share by Stage</div>
      <div class="card-sub">% of total food waste · Global average</div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:220px">
        <canvas id="chart-waste-share"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Carbon Emissions Share by Stage</div>
      <div class="card-sub">% of total food-waste CO₂e · Global</div>
