    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ══ SECTION 2: AVOIDABLE WASTE OVERLAY ══ -->
  <div class="section-break anim a4">
    <div class="section-label">Section 02 — Avoidable Loss</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">How Much Waste Is Technically Preventable?</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Avoidable waste proportions reveal intervention headroom. Processing and retail globally show the highest avoidable fractions (67% and 64%), while production in low-income regions reaches 72–75% avoidability despite carrying the largest waste share in those regions.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-2 anim a5">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">Avoidable Waste by Stage &amp; Region</div>
      <div class="card-sub">% of stage waste deemed avoidable · Grouped by region</div>
