  </div>

  <!-- ══ SECTION 4: PRIORITY INTERVENTION ══ -->
  <div class="section-break anim a6">
    <div class="section-label">Section 04 — Intervention Priority</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Convergence of High Waste, High Carbon &amp; High Avoidability</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Priority stages are those where avoidable waste volume and carbon savings potential overlap. Production and consumption emerge as dual-priority targets globally, but for distinct reasons — the former via carbon intensity and low-income region dominance, the latter via sheer volume in high-income markets.</p>
